    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/8f7c7a5b526de5396d8923587fa241b1.avif?t=1724172090\" /></div><br>In Sich Tactics you control the party of Cossacks of different classes and fight with enemies on procedurally generated arenas.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/f7735b925da0b59f9c815290e8f31e71.poster.avif?t=1724172090\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/f7735b925da0b59f9c815290e8f31e71.webm?t=1724172090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/f7735b925da0b59f9c815290e8f31e71.mp4?t=1724172090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deep turn-based tactics</h2>It is a small game with quick game sessions and deep tactics. One of the key features is the use of verticality to your advantage.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/c06ba91c2b794711d702254debb9eee4.poster.avif?t=1724172090\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/c06ba91c2b794711d702254debb9eee4.webm?t=1724172090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/c06ba91c2b794711d702254debb9eee4.mp4?t=1724172090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cossacks of different classes</h2>Each class has unique abilities and plays its role on the battlefield. But the real strength lies in their smart interaction.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Various enemies of vivid Ukrainian mythology</h2>We are inspired by rich and variegated Ukrainian mythology. You have to fight with chorts, foresters, water demons... and maybe with Viy themself?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/787b41c1da33521ff7210b28cb3fb066.poster.avif?t=1724172090\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/787b41c1da33521ff7210b28cb3fb066.webm?t=1724172090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/787b41c1da33521ff7210b28cb3fb066.mp4?t=1724172090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Procedurally generated arenas and scenarios</h2>Scenarios differ in biomes, possible enemies, and consist of several complex battles arenas for which are procedurally generated.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Competitive mode with leaderboard</h2>In a special mode with an endless waves of enemies you can compete with other players for the title of Kish Otaman.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/8f7c7a5b526de5396d8923587fa241b1.avif?t=1724172090\" /></div><br>In Sich Tactics you control the party of Cossacks of different classes and fight with enemies on procedurally generated arenas.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/f7735b925da0b59f9c815290e8f31e71.poster.avif?t=1724172090\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/f7735b925da0b59f9c815290e8f31e71.webm?t=1724172090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/f7735b925da0b59f9c815290e8f31e71.mp4?t=1724172090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deep turn-based tactics</h2>It is a small game with quick game sessions and deep tactics. One of the key features is the use of verticality to your advantage.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/c06ba91c2b794711d702254debb9eee4.poster.avif?t=1724172090\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/c06ba91c2b794711d702254debb9eee4.webm?t=1724172090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/c06ba91c2b794711d702254debb9eee4.mp4?t=1724172090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cossacks of different classes</h2>Each class has unique abilities and plays its role on the battlefield. But the real strength lies in their smart interaction.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Various enemies of vivid Ukrainian mythology</h2>We are inspired by rich and variegated Ukrainian mythology. You have to fight with chorts, foresters, water demons... and maybe with Viy themself?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/787b41c1da33521ff7210b28cb3fb066.poster.avif?t=1724172090\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/787b41c1da33521ff7210b28cb3fb066.webm?t=1724172090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064100/extras/787b41c1da33521ff7210b28cb3fb066.mp4?t=1724172090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Procedurally generated arenas and scenarios</h2>Scenarios differ in biomes, possible enemies, and consist of several complex battles arenas for which are procedurally generated.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Competitive mode with leaderboard</h2>In a special mode with an endless waves of enemies you can compete with other players for the title of Kish Otaman.",
